=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# environment origin -------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# origin/main's Environment screen, its words as they are$
# (environment_settings_menu.go:34-64), on the design system, on$
# the debian13 host: its two lines, under the proposed section's$
# header (origin/main has none), and its two items, whose labels$
# push the menu's descriptions under them.$
$
# Environment Variable Settings ################################$
$
# HARDN_CONFIG -------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  HARDN_CONFIG environment variable is not set$
  [ ] Sudo preservation    Disabled$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Setup sudo environment preservation$
      Configure sudo to preserve HARDN_CONFIG$
   2) Show environment variables guide$
      Learn how to set up environment variables$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-2 or q]:$
$
$

